  <constraints>
    <constraint source="no-errors / data-integrity">A born-in-editor doc's 2nd..Nth in-session save MUST succeed (no 400/404). MUST NOT regress the loaded/imported tracked-change path (REQ-2). MUST NOT introduce silent data loss.</constraint>
    <constraint source="R5 boundary">Do NOT implement deferred features (versioning dropdown, transient-mount projection unification, external-change banner, comment scroll-sync, profile re-run). Scope is BUG A + P1-P4 only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent v9 tokens only; icon-only toggle keeps aria-label; dark-mode test green.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038 / NFR-06">Add a seam/behavior test proving the born-in-editor 2nd save succeeds + updates the same item (no create-on-save). No banned Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;/DI/ctor tests.</constraint>
