  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor">FULL rigor declaration. Re-read the 4 target files to confirm current line anchors (they shifted post-merge). Load the R5 README + uat notes.</step>
    <step order="1" name="BUG A server">ComposeEndpoints.cs replace-path validation: accept a non-empty contentModel as a valid dirty save (add to the OR). Confirm the replace branch updates the existing item.</step>
    <step order="2" name="BUG A client">ComposeWorkspace.tsx triggerSave: born-in-editor (`!state.docxBytes`) replace saves send `{contentModel}` (mirror the create path). Loaded path unchanged.</step>
